      "value": "Ouch, I've been having the same issue, and same error on my log, always when joining a discord voice chat, it disconnects me from the world, but I don't think it's a VRChat issue, since my SlimeVR server gets yeeted with it. I think it's something to do with discord + windows messing with it.",
