      "value": "About two or three weeks ago, and multiple random times this evening, this error appeared. I'm not in discord, but it was minimized. With it Quit/exited, managed 30 minutes, then crashed.\n\nPC Restarted, network restarted, modem too, cleared cache, IPv4 only on my adapter, steady ping and speed tests...all good.\n\nSteam VR to quest3 over wifi, or, Valve Index, doesn't matter.\n\nWindows 10 (for now)",
