      "value": "I had been able to play with VRChat without encountering this issue for quite some time, but just now I managed to reproduce it.\n\nIt was unclear whether enabling UAC or switching to Cloudflare WARP was the solution, but since this reoccurrence happened with Discord.exe in \"Elevated: No\" state, it's almost certain to be an issue with my internet environment (which I suspect might be related to MAP-E).",
